Package: ReproducibleNDI
Title: Reproducing the Neighborhood Deprivation Index of Neighborhood Socioeconomic Status
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Rafael", "Catoia Pulgrossi", email = "rcatoiap@stanford.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Tae Yoon", "Lee", email = "harrytyl@stanford.edu", role = c("aut")))
Description: Provides a simple, tidy interface for calculating the Neighborhood
    Deprivation Index (NDI), a composite measure of neighborhood-level
    socioeconomic status (SES), using data from the US Census Bureau's American
    Community Survey (ACS). Features include automatic data fetching, flexible
    geographies (county, tract, block group), and optional spatial imputation.
